* Integration with an external data source to populate the `entry_t` structures with initial data before randomization.
* Simulation of an unreliable data source by periodically failing to provide data and implementing fallback mechanisms.

Note that this is just one possible implementation, and there may be other ways to achieve the desired functionality depending on the specific requirements of the project.']

